cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite gantrain when using it in research, software, or creative work."
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-07"
title: "gantrain: Train a FastGAN on your own photographs, on one GPU"
authors:
  - family-names: Cortal
    given-names: Gustave
abstract: >-
  gantrain trains FastGAN generative adversarial networks (GANs) on a personal
  photo collection, on one GPU, up to 3072x2048. It curates the photographs,
  trains, samples, and evaluates whether the generator makes new images rather
  than copies. Its checkpoints play live in ganlive.
repository-code: "https://github.com/gustavecortal/gantrain"
url: "https://github.com/gustavecortal/gantrain"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - generative adversarial networks
  - FastGAN
  - few-shot image generation
  - high-resolution image synthesis
  - generative art
